        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global TH1102 Mortise Lock Body Hookbolt For Sliding Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAluminum frame or hollow metal frame sliding door mortise hookbolt body. Hookbolts are also used on some swinging storefront doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Complete Sets: \r\n<a href=\"/products/sliding-storefront-door-mortise-deadbolt-lockset-zinc-cylinders-th1102-pz\"><b>with Zinc Cylinders</b></a>,\r\n<a href=\"/products/sliding-storefront-door-mortise-hookbolt-lockset-brass-cylinders-th1102-pb\"><b>with Brass Cylinders</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/sliding-store-front-door-high-security-mortise-hookbolt-lockset-mul-t-lock-cylinders-th1102-pm\"><b>High Security Mul-T-Lock Cylinders</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 31/32\", 1-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Non handed</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate: Width - 1\", Length - 6-7/8\", Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Case Dimensions: Width - 7/8\", Length -  6\", Depth (specific to backset) - 1.63\" through 1.78\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: Width - 5/8\", Length - 1-3/8\", Throw - 15/16”</li>\r\n<li>*Lock Body Only. Does NOT include <a href=\"/products/mortise-hookbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp6-10\"><b>Hookbolt Faceplate</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
